= The Democratic Party Challenges Erim

Despite managing to gain MGP to our side for the interpellation, we fail to convince the leadership of AP party group to go against Demirel's authority, therefore DP's motion lacks enough votes to pass and fails. While it is still obvious that Erim's time is very short, we've only succeeded in annoying the Military and making İnönü very angry, who is getting madder and madder at Ecevit and begins to truly sees him as a troublemaker delinquent.

